00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:36.776
SINDAP RAILWAY BRIDGE, CHEONGGYECHEON

00:04:36.859 --> 00:04:39.237
Back under Park Chung Hee,
they covered up Cheonggyecheon

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.531
