So what?

00:04:48.913 --> 00:04:50.832
From Cheonggye Plaza where we started

00:04:51.165 --> 00:04:54.210
to under that Sindap Railway Bridge
you see over there.

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:56.838
That's the stretch
